                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "这边是服务台，\n与房屋建造、友邻定居相关的服务，\n都可以在这里和我商量。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_502701_3513828001_content",
                "value": "这边是服务台，\n与房屋建造、友邻定居相关的服务，\n都可以在这里和我商量。",
